            "description": "# wizcli\n\nControl your WiZ light from the terminal.\n\n```bash\n# turn on\n$ wiz on\n\n# turn off\n$ wiz off\n\n# dim to 20%\n$ wiz dim 20\n\n# set temp to 50%\n$ wiz temp 50\n\n# set cold\n$ wiz cold\n\n# set hot\n$ wiz hot\n\n# set RGB color\n$ wiz rgb 255 40 90\n```\n",
